      "display": "##.###.###/####-##",
      "note": {
        "en": "Receita Federal began issuing alphanumeric CNPJs in July 2026 under IN RFB 2229/2024: the first twelve characters may be digits or capital letters, each worth its ASCII code less 48, and the two check digits stay numeric. Numbers issued before then are unchanged and still validate."
